+     * @param removedFaceKey the {@link SubdivisionFace#key} of the removed {@link SubdivisionFace}, if any
+     * @throws IllegalArgumentException if {@code changedFaceKey} is negative
+     *                                  and {@code removedFaceKey} is non-negative
